{
  "comment": [
    "Golden vectors for the commit graph's records (docs/scm.md, \"The commit graph\").",
    "internal/scm/encoding (Go) must encode each valid vector's records to exactly its bytes, and both",
    "it and jj's encoding (Rust) must decode the bytes to exactly the records, in order, and refuse every",
    "invalid vector's bytes. IDs are hex; a filter of null is none; a byte string is the concatenation",
    "of its lines, each hex."
